  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "Pump Hands-Free, Anywhere You Go | Fits in Your Bra. Weighs 8 oz | Control Your Pump From Your Phone | No Cords. No Tubes. No Sitting. | 3 Modes, 9 Levels, 285 mmHg | Track output by day, week, or month in the app. 30-minute auto stop built in. | HSA/FSA eligible. 30-day returns and a 1-year warranty on every pump. | Rated 4.6 by 1,740 moms. Free 30-minute 1-on-1 IBCLC consult with US orders. | Only 4 parts to clean, sterilized in 3 minutes. Six sessions on a single charge. | 3 modes, 9 suction levels, and app control — no reaching into your bra mid-session.",
